# PROVENANCE.md category 1: original work written from scratch for
# libfprint, licensed the same as the rest of the tree. Exception:
# egis0576_proto.c's EGIS_STEP_TABLE is a 16-entry table taken byte-exact
# from the vendor DLL's .rdata, and PROVENANCE.md places it in category 2
# (see the Files stanza below); dep5 has no way to license part of a file
# separately, so this stanza covers the file as a whole and the exception
# is recorded here in prose, matching PROVENANCE.md's own treatment of it.
